    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Proscovia Nabatte has always believed in the power of storytelling. Now, she's living one of her own, navigating a unique chapter as both a Master's student at Aga Khan University's Graduate School of Media and Communications (GSMC) and the newly appointed Communications and Marketing Specialist for AKU in Uganda.",
